### real-nan-encoded
# CR-102 regression vectors (through capacity-errors): behavior that the
# no-float refactor and the shared tag-header / minimal-length integer
# writers must preserve.  CR-103 item 2 changed the two NaN blocks: NaN
# (quiet or signalling, either sign, any payload) was rejected and is now
# encoded bit for bit like any other value.
enc_real 7fc00000
enc_real 7f800001
enc_real ffc00000
---
OK 447fc00000
OK 447f800001
OK 44ffc00000
