### utf8-well-formed
# CR-103 vectors (from here to the end of the file).
# Item 1: well-formed UTF-8 (RFC 3629) is accepted: the empty string, U+0000,
# and the lowest/highest octets of every sequence length (U+0080, U+07FF,
# U+0800, U+D7FF, U+E000, U+FFFF, U+10000, U+10FFFF), then e-acute, the euro
# sign and U+1F600.
enc_str -
enc_str 00
enc_str 7f
enc_str c280+dfbf
enc_str e0a080+ed9fbf+ee8080+efbfbf
enc_str f0908080+f48fbfbf
enc_str c3a9+e282ac+f09f9880
enc_str rep:41:300+f48fbfbf
---
OK 7100
OK 720000
OK 72007f
OK 750500c280dfbf
OK 750d00e0a080ed9fbfee8080efbfbf
OK 750900f0908080f48fbfbf
OK 750a00c3a9e282acf09f9880
OK 75fe0131004141414141414141414141..fb2de7bebf30cbe5/309
### utf8-ill-formed
# Item 1: ill-formed UTF-8 is rejected and the buffer is left unchanged.
# Stray continuation octets; truncated 2/3/4-octet sequences (also at the
# end of a long string); a non-continuation octet inside a sequence;
# overlong forms (C0, C1, E0 80..9F, F0 80..8F); surrogates U+D800, U+DFFF
# and a CESU-8 surrogate pair; code points above U+10FFFF (F4 90, F5..F7);
# the octets F8..FF.
enc_str 80
enc_str 41+bf
enc_str c2
enc_str e282
enc_str f09f98
enc_str rep:41:300+e282
enc_str c241
enc_str e28241
enc_str f09f4180
enc_str c080
enc_str c1bf
enc_str e09fbf
enc_str f08fbfbf
